msgid "OpenVR is the original API Valve created to interface with SteamVR. Support for this API is offered through the `Godot OpenVR plugin. <https://github.com/godotvr/godot_openvr>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/openvr_intro.rst:9
msgid "For any new XR project we highly recommend using Godot's built-in OpenXR support. The OpenVR plugin can be applicable for some niche use cases such as creating OpenVR Overlays."
